  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 401.06 “Preparatory and complementary procedures” means procedures that are currently taught in accredited chiropractic colleges through the professional degree program or at the post-graduate level.\n\nSource. #9358, eff 1-10-09 (from Ch 401.05), EXPIRED: 1-10-17\n\nNew. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17\n\nNew. #12431, eff 12-8-17",
